# ============================================
# DVC with Google Drive (Public Sharing)
# ============================================
#
# Setup Instructions:
# 1. Create a folder in Google Drive for your DVC/model files
# 2. Upload your trained model files to this folder
# 3. Right-click the folder -> Share -> "Anyone with the link" -> Viewer
# 4. Copy the folder ID from URL: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/FOLDER_ID
# 5. Run: dvc remote modify gdrive url gdrive://YOUR_FOLDER_ID
#
# For pushing new models:
# - You need to authenticate locally with: dvc push
# - This will open a browser for Google OAuth (one-time setup)
#
# For pulling (CI/CD and team members):
# - No authentication needed if folder is shared publicly!
# - Just run: dvc pull





